.TH SQUIDYGIT 1 "August 2026" "SquidyGit @PROJECT_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
SquidyGit \- native desktop Git client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B SquidyGit
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B SquidyGit
is a graphical Git client with repository history, staging, branch management,
and a built-in log of executed Git commands.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/SquidyGit/
.RS
Per-user application settings.
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR git (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Sergey Yakunin <sergey@squidy.ru>
